Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the lights go out across the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear anything from the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. The signal keeps dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave before the last train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised I'd wait until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The map says there's another road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That bridge has been closed for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I'll check the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're at the right address?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's someone at the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down. They might hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quiet for a while, then the alarms started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One more minute. I just need to find the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll call you when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,昨日のこと、まだ覚えてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,うん。でも今は話したくない。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,明日の朝、駅で待ってるよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,今日は本当にありがとう。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.\NCan you explain it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The first page is missing; check the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a pause here... and then everyone cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened next? Tell me everything.
